<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->
<section class="hero">
<h1>
Condiments vs Sauces: F&amp;B Terminology Poster
</h1>
<p class="subtitle">
A quick-reference training poster for hospitality and restaurant teams —
the difference between a sauce and a condiment, with examples of each and
why the distinction matters for service standards.
</p>
<p class="byline">
By <strong>Nigel A. Thomas</strong><br/>
Hospitality Executive &amp; Corporate Trainer
</p>
<a class="download-btn" download="" href="assets/condiments-vs-sauces-poster.png">Download Poster (PNG)</a>
</section>
